# Vercel build artifact: vercel.json's buildCommand copies the Vite build
# output here so it matches Vercel's zero-config Express convention (static
# assets must live in public/** at project root) -- built fresh on every
# Vercel deploy, never hand-edited or committed, same convention as dist/
public

